name tonevalue
category Package
revision 60058
shortdesc Tool for linguists and phoneticians to visualize tone value patterns
longdesc This package provides a TikZ-based solution to typeset
longdesc visualisations of tone values. Currently, unt's model is
longdesc implemented. Support for more models is planned.
